{"seq":5,"slug":"network-science","title":"网络科学","stage":"DONE","category":"systems-thinking","chapterCount":3,"docCount":14,"url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.23,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 网络科学 简介\n\n网络科学研究由节点和连接构成的复杂关系结构。从社交网络到互联网，从神经网络到生态食物链，从交通网络到供应链——网络无处不在。网络科学提供了一套统一的数学语言和分析工具，用于理解这些看似不同领域中网络结构的共同规律和动态行为。\n\n本知识库面向希望理解网络结构和网络行为的技术从业者。你不需要图论的深厚数学背景，但对关系型数据和结构化思维的兴趣将帮助你更好地掌握内容。对于从事社交产品、推荐系统、分布式系统或任何涉及连接与传播的领域的读者，网络科学将提供有价值的分析视角。\n\n全书共分三章，从数学基础到宏观属性再到动态过程，构建完整的网络科学知识体系。\n\n第一章**图论基础**建立分析网络的数学语言。图是网络的抽象数学表示，掌握图的基本概念、类型、算法和度量指标，是进行任何网络分析的前提。这一章为你提供必要的工具箱。\n\n第二章**网络属性**探讨真实世界网络共有的宏观特征。小世界现象解释了为什么任意两人之间只需六步就能建立联系，无标度特性揭示了网络中枢纽节点的关键作用，社区结构展现了网络中的自然聚类，网络韧性则关系到系统在面对攻击或故障时的生存能力。\n\n第三章**网络动力学**聚焦于网络上发生的动态过程。信息如何在网络中扩散？疾病如何通过接触网络传播？网络自身又如何随时间演化？这一章将静态的网络结构分析扩展为动态的过程分析。\n\n推荐按章节顺序学习。图论基础提供分析语言，网络属性建立对真实网络的宏观认知，网络动力学将结构与行为连接起来。如果你有图论基础，可以直接进入第二章。对于关注病毒传播、信息扩散或产品增长的读者，第三章的内容尤为实用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-theory-basics","title":"图论基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-fundamentals","title":"图论基础","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-types","title":"图的分类","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-algorithms","title":"图算法","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-algorithms"},{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-metrics","title":"图的度量指标","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/graph-theory-basics/graph-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-properties","title":"网络属性","docCount":4,"url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"small-world","title":"小世界网络","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/small-world"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scale-free","title":"无标度网络","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/scale-free"},{"seq":3,"slug":"community-structure","title":"社区结构","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/community-structure"},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-resilience","title":"网络韧性","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-properties/network-resilience"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-dynamics","title":"网络动力学","docCount":6,"url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"diffusion-on-networks","title":"网络扩散","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/diffusion-on-networks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"epidemic-models","title":"流行病模型","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/epidemic-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multilayer-networks","title":"多层网络","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/multilayer-networks"},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-propagation","title":"网络传播","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/network-propagation"},{"seq":5,"slug":"network-evolution","title":"网络演化","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/network-evolution"},{"seq":6,"slug":"network-evolution","title":"网络演化","url":"/h/systems-thinking/network-science/network-dynamics/network-evolution"}]}]}